\title{Agent use and human digestion}

\p{The project tests a workflow for preparing a draft formalization for human
examination:}

\ul{
  \li{\strong{Grounding:} mathematical claims tied to the papers;}
  \li{\strong{Traceability:} declaration-level provenance;}
  \li{\strong{Digest:} code paired with mathematical and design notes;}
  \li{\strong{Verification:} proof replay kept separate from mathematical
  review; and}
  \li{\strong{Human gate:} unresolved boundaries recorded, with corrections and landing under
  human control.}
}

\p{The public
\href{https://github.com/utensil/connes-rigidity/blob/main/docs/AUDITS.md}{audit ledger},
\href{https://github.com/utensil/connes-rigidity/blob/main/docs/PROVENANCE.md}{provenance ledger},
and
\href{https://github.com/utensil/connes-rigidity/blob/main/docs/COMPARATOR.md}{Comparator trust-boundary note}
make those roles explicit. This is a draft prepared for human examination, not
a claim of independent peer review.}
